        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to other RNA-targeted product candidates, we are conducting research and development of a cancer vaccine product candidate and an oncolytic immunotherapy platform.",
