        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043810-72a42458c2335ee6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043810",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Against this conceptual framework, we have designed our lead therapeutic-candidate, TTX-MC138, which is designed with the potential to efficiently inhibit microRNA-10b in metastatic cancers.",
        "start_character": 52663,
        "end_character": 52853
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043810",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043810-72a42458c2335ee6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043810",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Armed with this knowledge, we can take advantage of the coded nature of the genome to design specific oligos that correspond",
        "start_character": 9407,
        "end_character": 9531
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043810",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043810-72a42458c2335ee6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043810",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on in vivo studies using TTX-siPDL1 to treat human pancreatic tumors implanted in animals, we applied for and, in June 2022, received, Orphan Drug Designation for the treatment of pancreatic cancer.",
        "start_character": 79495,
        "end_character": 79699
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043810",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043810-72a42458c2335ee6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043810",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, in February 2023, we received Orphan Drug Designation from the FDA for TTX-MC138, also for the treatment of pancreatic cancer.",
        "start_character": 79700,
        "end_character": 79839
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-043810",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-043810-72a42458c2335ee6",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-043810",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In our preclinical studies, we used our lead therapeutic, TTX-MC138, which is designed to specifically target miRNA-10b.",
